":"U-ma","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:31312","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"結希","creatorId":"vndb:s33835","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s33835","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33835","name":"結希","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:31315","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151266","characterName":"相葉 一成","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151266"},"originalCharacterName":"相葉 一成","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42985","characterName":"相葉 奈々子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42985"},"originalCharacterName":"相葉 奈々子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1023"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She married Eiichi, the older brother of Issei who was her senior in high school, and moved to Tokyo upon graduation. They had a happy married life, but two years ago, Eiichi died suddenly and she became a widow."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a motherly woman with a ladylike and warm atmosphere. Although she is a little vague in some respects, she is an adult woman in proportion to her age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she appears to be generous, her inner life is complicated and full of conflicts. She is currently showing a stout smile to those around her, but in her heart, she is desperate to recover from her grief."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is always kind and considerate to Issei, who is a student preparing for an entrance examination, but to Nanako, Issei is just her husband's younger brother. Of course, she has no idea about Issei's feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c58c67b1ba279b5b0438488f11fb7847da5120ec495e2ea633b54bfd68e7e8d8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9b36151ade303702f3184f25c21f4298337311b18361dee1c6cf48d75909580.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"涼森 ちさと","creatorId":"vndb:s445","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s445","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s445","name":"涼森ちさと","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16421","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42986","characterName":"森尾 結花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42986"},"originalCharacterName":"森尾 結花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"219"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nanako's younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She came to Tokyo to attend a preparatory school, but was puzzled because she did not know that Issei would be attending the same school with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is serious and firm, even a little too fastidious. She is the type of person who says what she wants to say firmly and is constantly arguing with Issei, but in fact, she is a naive girl who always pays attention to those around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is concerned about Nanako, who has just lost her husband, but she is also worried about Issei. She is the first to notice Nanako's feelings for Issei and has mixed feelings for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42986"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74d356a21f342985678e239eac54598bcb5218bd6348a1489461802345aa1302.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/4316a8ec4bcd86844daa3e0c3ee8af52886c6146d6cfd0faecfd3b22a994a01b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさり☆","creatorId":"vndb:s1420","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1420","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1420","name":"あさり☆","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16422","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42987","characterName":"鳥越 千草","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42987"},"originalCharacterName":"鳥越 千草","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1027"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"94"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She left her parents' home for Tokyo at a young age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a married woman, but is a fun loving at heart, so there are always rumors of her being unfaithful. She often comes to Nanako's house without hesitation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a flamboyant personality (and looks), and is a bit of a rascal in many ways. She takes advantage of her husband's meekness and continues to play around wildly even after marriage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lacks a sense of guilt about her sexuality and is often tempting Issei. At the core, however, she is an experienced adult and a reliable person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She watches the relationship between Issei, Nanako, and Yuka from a distance. She is interested in the young and inexperienced Issei."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/311fd08ac99a5473f218d74475ea04cc39b6343baf8a5f41398f42b1d6bd0d2e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/0644d08fa24b85be60fb7544b58ce1f4e823c104ea6438e565c6abdf2e0943ba.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"比未子","creatorId":"vndb:s1499","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1499","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1499","name":"比未子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16423","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42988","characterName":"瀬能 穂奈美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42988"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬能 穂奈美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"417"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"100"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"93"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a senior at Issei's part-time job."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband is a serious and mild-mannered businessman, but he is currently working abroad. Honami is left alone and feels lonely. She likes Issei, who is similar to her husband, and approaches him aggressively."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is innocent and natural. She always has a smile on her face. She is honest about her feelings and approaches Issei. Despite her friendly atmosphere, she is sexually mature and experienced."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While other characters are unable to be honest about their feelings, she acts on her feelings innocently, surprising everyone around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42988"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/447f3e4a3639fdfba1a000f0c5d790ee0c0b80366275708bc710d3a521694ace.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce51f949cc7f816a224cb5336226387eba9506a64c91c30a71b268651456eb32.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"紬 叶慧","creatorId":"vndb:s2920","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2920","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2920","name":"紬 叶慧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16424","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42989","characterName":"沢木 藍子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42989"},"originalCharacterName":"沢木 藍子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"523"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"95"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the wife of Sawaki, the manager of the store where Issei works part-time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike today's married women, she loves her husband, Kentaro, deeply. She loves him so much that she cannot control her feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She senses the change in her husband's feelings when he has his eyes on other women and is in anguish."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42989"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddb6b8710fe87745d47cb0a40aad3267a675139fd755d2151c316efb9c79c702.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f85d4e866d41a52b2f024fabc8eb037a6dc63880f0996a59de0a87a9ed44a9c2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天天","creatorId":"vndb:s2922","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2922","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2922","name":"天天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16425","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42990","characterName":"沢木 節子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42990"},"originalCharacterName":"沢木 節子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"909"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"95"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mature wife who seduces Issei with her mysterious and bewitching smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is actually Aiko's mother. She sometimes watches Issei from the shadows as he visits the Sawaki family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42990"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbc9c3c77de3009e29d456e0797be8c725f6c0e5e3801bdb3fb830a7247d6739.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d163f0687ecf8111e8b245f90b55f69528c2b3f366aa70c7ee1507b6ee6d7e13.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天天","creatorId":"vndb:s2922","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2922","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2922","name":"天天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16426","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p560","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:139","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p560","name":"13cm","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:3724:139","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p560","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p560","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p560","name":"13cm","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:33631:v2052","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p560","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p560","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p560","name":"13cm","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:4830:v2052","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p560","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p560","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p560","name":"13cm","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:4831:v2052","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-ru